  "adaptation": [
    "Retain adaptive size-based grids, per-grid arrival counters, peer HCA mapping, proxy wire protocol and native collective math.",
    "Add caller-owned prepared RoCE declarations and execution handles without runtime kernel resolution.",
    "Keep stream waits before shared staging writes and completion events after output copies.",
    "Bind immutable peer-path and capacity settings in prepared query identity; opposite_paths is distinct from HCA inventory count.",
    "Supervise every peer wait from the proxy thread: kernels poll a host abort word, the proxy stops waits only for an unreachable, stopped or inconsistent peer or after B12X_ROCE_PEER_TIMEOUT_S, notifies peers when it stops, and logs each stall."
  ],
